  "story": {
    "day": 166,
    "title": "Kaya's Festival and Trip Plans",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya's moral education class finished.",
      "She began to research food for the public festival.",
      "\"We'll certainly raise a million yen!\" she thought.",
      "Kaya looked forward to selling curry and spaghetti.",
      "\"I'll prepare forty ounces of cabbage for steak,\" she decided.",
      "\"You'll also get some corn and lettuce,\" her friend answered.",
      "\"For dessert, she'll make apple pie.\"",
      "Later, the bell rang at 4:00 p.m.",
      "\"It'll be fun skiing this winter, of course,\" Kaya said.",
      "\"They'll see many animals like horses, zebras, and sheep.\"",
      "\"We mustn't heat the octopus too much.\"",
      "\"I won't borrow your special dolphin-shaped molds,\" Kaya joked."
    ]
  }
